+
+You are running inside `/Users/suman/playground/chitra`, a **Vajra-governed repo**.
+
+1. STOP and read, in order: `.ai/AGENTS.md`, `.ai/SESSION`, `.ai/SESSION-BOOT.md`, `.ai/TASK.md`,
